{"unit_id":"lyonleeeee__dsh-steer#card-zh","repo":"lyonleeeee/dsh-steer","commit":"44cc92b1e20f6272506a4fba10e5fa6f2ca036b5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-steer（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为长时间运行的会话提供实时状态查看和不中断当前任务的补充指导。它在会话头部加入状态徽标、诊断详情和指导入口，并通过宿主事件更新运行阶段。主要功能包括查看当前阶段与进展、在最近的小步边界向运行中的 Agent 补充或纠正指令、附加图片或文件、查看指导历史并重发未读取内容，以及切换中英文界面。适合需要观察长任务并在执行中调整方向的 DSH 用户。需要 DSH 提供 agents、webServer 服务；附件能力依赖宿主可用的附件接口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:490-520","lib/index.js:702-738","lib/client.js:323-421","lib/client.js:691-703"]}
{"unit_id":"lyonleeeee__dsh-steer#card-en","repo":"lyonleeeee/dsh-steer","commit":"44cc92b1e20f6272506a4fba10e5fa6f2ca036b5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-steer adds live status and in-flight guidance to DSH's web client. A session header badge shows the agent's phase. Users can send corrections without interrupting work, attach files, review guidance history, and resend unread entries. It uses the host agents and webServer services.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:490-520","lib/index.js:702-738","lib/client.js:323-421","lib/client.js:691-703"]}
