{"unit_id":"lyonleeeee__dsh-steer#feature-1","repo":"lyonleeeee/dsh-steer","commit":"44cc92b1e20f6272506a4fba10e5fa6f2ca036b5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-steer 的功能「会话实时状态」：在会话头部显示 Agent 阶段、当前进度和运行详情，并通过事件流接收状态快照。打开会话后自动订阅状态，连接中断时会显示连接状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:490-520","lib/index.js:714-731","lib/client.js:323-340"]}
